    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>From King Nothing · <strong>Price:</strong> you need an item the target touched.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Theme</strong> Mind and Sense</p><hr />\n<ul><li><strong>1:</strong> You can track a creature by scent; +2 Survival to Track.</li><li><strong>5:</strong> You know its location within 1 mile.</li><li><strong>9:</strong> Surge: follow a scent back to learn where the target was 1 hour ago.</li><li><strong>13:</strong> You can track through teleportation.</li><li><strong>17:</strong> You know its location within 10 miles.</li></ul>\n\n<p><em>Defaults: Stand, Occult and Concentrate traits; a surge costs 1 Stand Point and 2 actions unless listed; ranges are measured from your stand; untyped damage is force; saves use your stand DC.</em></p>",
